# ============================================================
# Agent — Manage & list agents
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### List agents
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/agent

### Get a specific agent
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/agent/{{agentID}}

# Replace {{agentID}} with an actual agent id, e.g. "build".
# GET http://localhost:4096/api/agent/build
